{"seq":3,"slug":"vector-search-problem","title":"向量检索问题与维度灾难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/foundations/vector-search-problem","wordCount":1383,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"向量检索问题与维度灾难\">向量检索问题与维度灾难</h1><p>有了向量、有了度量，最朴素的检索方法呼之欲出：把查询向量和库里每一条都算一遍距离，取最近的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个。这叫精确最近邻（exact kNN），它永远 100% 准确。问题是它在大规模高维数据上慢到不可用——本节解释「慢」的两个来源（规模与维度），并说明为什么整个向量检索领域几乎都建立在「主动放弃精确」这个看似反直觉的决定之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-精确检索的代价\">核心概念：精确检索的代价</h2><p>暴力 kNN 对每个查询要做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次距离计算，每次距离是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 维运算，单查询复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N \\cdot d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个线性看起来不吓人，但代入真实数字就崩了：十亿条 1536 维向量，单查询要做约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5 \\times 10^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次浮点乘加，即便每秒百亿次浮点也要上百秒。而生产检索的延迟预算通常是毫秒级。</p>\n<p>下表展示规模如何把暴力检索推出可用区间。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>维度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>单查询浮点量级</th>\n<th>暴力可行性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>768</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>完全可行，毫秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>768</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>勉强，需 SIMD/GPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>1536</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 10^{11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>不可行（秒级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>1536</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 10^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>完全不可行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正是这条曲线，逼出了第二章的全部三类近似索引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"维度灾难-高维空间的反直觉\">维度灾难：高维空间的反直觉</h2><p>规模只是问题的一半，另一半藏在「维度」里。在高维空间中，距离这个概念本身会退化：随着 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 增大，任意两点之间的最近距离与最远距离的比值趋近于 1。形式化地，对均匀分布的点，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{d \\to \\infty} \\frac{\\mathbb{E}[d_{\\max}] - \\mathbb{E}[d_{\\min}]}{\\mathbb{E}[d_{\\min}]} \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">lim</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直观讲就是：在很高维度里，所有点彼此「差不多远」，「最近邻」相比「随便一个邻居」并没有明显更近。这让基于划分空间的传统方法（如 KD-tree）彻底失效——它们在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d &gt; 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 左右就退化成全表扫描。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[精确 kNN&lt;br/&gt;O N*d] --&gt; B{N 大?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[暴力检索即可]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{d 高?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否 低维| E[KD-tree 等空间划分]&#10;    D --&gt;|是 高维| F[维度灾难&lt;br/&gt;空间划分失效]&#10;    F --&gt; G[近似最近邻 ANN]&#10;    G --&gt; H[用召回率换速度]\">flowchart TD\n    A[精确 kNN&lt;br/&gt;O N*d] --&gt; B{N 大?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[暴力检索即可]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{d 高?}\n    D --&gt;|否 低维| E[KD-tree 等空间划分]\n    D --&gt;|是 高维| F[维度灾难&lt;br/&gt;空间划分失效]\n    F --&gt; G[近似最近邻 ANN]\n    G --&gt; H[用召回率换速度]</pre><h2 id=\"用召回率换速度\">用召回率换速度</h2><p>既然精确不可得，就重新定义目标：不再要求返回真正的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，而是返回「大概率包含大部分真 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>」的结果。衡量这个「大概率」的指标是召回率（recall@k）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>recall@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>返回的 top-</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>∩</mo><mtext>真实 top-</mtext><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{recall@}k = \\frac{|\\text{返回的 top-}k \\cap \\text{真实 top-}k|}{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">recall@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">返回的</span><span class=\"mord\"> top-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">真实</span><span class=\"mord\"> top-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>ANN 的全部艺术，就是在召回率、查询吞吐（QPS）、内存占用三者之间找平衡。提高召回通常要扫更多候选，于是 QPS 下降；省内存通常要压缩向量，于是召回下降。这是一条贯穿全 hub 的铁律——任何一个索引参数本质上都是在这个三角里挪动位置。召回率的系统化评估方法在 <a href=\"../applications/evaluation-tuning\">召回评估与调优</a> 里展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条技术路线的分岔\">三条技术路线的分岔</h2><p>面对维度灾难，2026 年的 ANN 实践收敛到三条互补的路线，它们正是下一章的三节内容。其一是分区：用聚类把空间切块、只搜相关块，代表是 <a href=\"../indexing/ivf-clustering\">倒排文件与聚类 IVF</a>。其二是图导航：在向量间建可导航的图、逐跳逼近，代表是 <a href=\"../indexing/hnsw-graphs\">HNSW 图索引</a>。其三是压缩：把向量量化成几个字节、减少计算与内存，代表是 <a href=\"../indexing/quantization\">量化：PQ 与 SQ</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>省的是</th>\n<th>典型软肋</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分区</td>\n<td>IVF</td>\n<td>比较次数</td>\n<td>簇边界漏召回、需训练重建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导航</td>\n<td>HNSW</td>\n<td>比较次数</td>\n<td>内存高、过滤下尾延迟陡增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩</td>\n<td>PQ / SQ</td>\n<td>内存与带宽</td>\n<td>有损，必须配精排兜底</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三条路线不是单选题。生产系统常把它们叠起来用：先量化压缩、再用 IVF 分区、最后精排重算。理解了「为什么必须近似」，再去看这些组合就不再是堆砌技巧，而是对同一个召回—延迟—内存三角的不同攻法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个常见误解-精确检索从未消失\">一个常见误解：精确检索从未消失</h2><p>需要澄清的是，放弃精确并不意味着精确检索毫无用处。它在两个地方依然不可或缺。其一是「金标准」：要衡量 ANN 的召回率，必须先用暴力精确检索算出真正的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 作为标准答案，否则连「准不准」都无从谈起，这正是 <a href=\"../applications/evaluation-tuning\">召回评估与调优</a> 的基石。其二是「精排」：几乎所有大规模方案都先用近似手段快速圈出几百个候选，再对这一小撮候选做精确距离计算重新排序——此时候选数已小到精确检索完全负担得起，于是同一份精确计算从「全库不可行」变成了「局部很划算」。</p>\n<p>换句话说，规模问题不是靠抛弃精确解决的，而是靠「把精确计算限制在一个被近似手段大幅缩小的候选集上」解决的。这种「近似召回 + 精确精排」的两段式结构，会在后面几乎每一种工程方案里反复出现，是理解整个领域的一把钥匙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>暴力 kNN 复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N \\cdot d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在亿级、千维规模下慢到不可用。</li>\n<li>维度灾难让高维空间里「远近」退化，传统空间划分（KD-tree）失效。</li>\n<li>ANN 主动放弃精确，用 recall@k 衡量近似质量。</li>\n<li>核心是召回率、QPS、内存的三角权衡，是全 hub 的主线；评估方法见 <a href=\"../applications/evaluation-tuning\">召回评估与调优</a>。</li>\n<li>三条互补路线：<a href=\"../indexing/ivf-clustering\">IVF 分区</a>、<a href=\"../indexing/hnsw-graphs\">HNSW 图</a>、<a href=\"../indexing/quantization\">量化压缩</a>，常组合使用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"向量检索问题与维度灾难","id":"向量检索问题与维度灾难"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：精确检索的代价","id":"核心概念-精确检索的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"维度灾难：高维空间的反直觉","id":"维度灾难-高维空间的反直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"用召回率换速度","id":"用召回率换速度"},{"level":2,"text":"三条技术路线的分岔","id":"三条技术路线的分岔"},{"level":2,"text":"一个常见误解：精确检索从未消失","id":"一个常见误解-精确检索从未消失"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"相似度度量：余弦、欧氏与点积","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/foundations/similarity-metrics"},"next":{"title":"倒排文件与聚类 IVF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/indexing/ivf-clustering"}}